{"3290620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pick My Heart Chapter 2", "steam_appid": 3290620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3295060], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heartfelt Connections</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick My Heart: Chapter 2 continues the romantic adventures of Sota and his encounters with goddesses and mortal friends. This anime-inspired visual novel unfolds in a vibrant modern world where myth and reality blend, leading to humorous, heartfelt, and sometimes challenging moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moments of Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chapter 2, Sota deepens his bonds with various characters, each carrying unique secrets and personalities. Whether it's Aphrodite, Hera, Athena, or Eris, Sota finds himself navigating through surprises, emotional revelations, and intense encounters that test his loyalty and affection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trials of Affection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each goddess brings a new perspective to Sota’s life. Whether meeting at a cozy karaoke club or exploring a quiet, romantic setting, Sota’s choices shape his journey, and each encounter brings him closer to understanding the complexities of love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern love story with a touch of mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that matter and shape the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four beautiful Greek goddesses, each with their own story and mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant blend of modern life and ancient myth as gods and mortals co-exist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unique locations and events, such as a date at a karaoke club</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The complex